<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 112,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 112,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog receipts Thursday were 112,000 head, compared with the estimate of 110,000, USDA said.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts $1.00 per cwt lower than midsession Thursday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
